  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The length of a seconds pendulum at a height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;from earth surface will be:</p><p>(Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Radius of earth and acceleration due to gravity at the surface of earth <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>",
