  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The acceleration due to gravity at height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;from the surface of the Earth will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Length of the second&#39;s pendulum at the surface of the Earth is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>.</p><p>Since, time period of a pendulum is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
